Since you prefer **one-line, concise answers**, here are the most likely viva questions with one-line answers.

# Practical 1 – SCVMM 2019

**Q. What is SCVMM?**
A. SCVMM is Microsoft software used to manage virtual machines, hosts, and private clouds.

**Q. Full form of SCVMM?**
A. System Center Virtual Machine Manager.

**Q. What is a cloud in SCVMM?**
A. A logical collection of virtualized resources for users.

**Q. What is a host?**
A. A physical server running Hyper-V.

**Q. What is a host group?**
A. A logical grouping of Hyper-V hosts.

**Q. What is a library server?**
A. It stores VM templates, ISOs, and VHDs.

**Q. What is a VM template?**
A. A predefined configuration used to create VMs.

**Q. What is a guarded host?**
A. A secure Hyper-V host that runs shielded VMs.

**Q. What is Host Guardian Service (HGS)?**
A. It verifies trusted hosts before starting shielded VMs.

**Q. What is a shielded VM?**
A. A VM protected against unauthorized access.

