# Practical 6 & 7 – DPM

**Q. Full form of DPM?**
A. Data Protection Manager.

**Q. Purpose of DPM?**
A. Backup and recovery of data.

**Q. What is a protection agent?**
A. Software installed on protected computers.

**Q. What is a protection group?**
A. A collection of data sources backed up together.

**Q. Why configure firewall?**
A. To allow DPM communication.

**Q. What is Hyper-V backup?**
A. Backup of virtual machines.

**Q. Why backup SQL Server?**
A. To protect databases.

**Q. What is Bare Metal Recovery?**
A. Restoring an entire server after failure.

**Q. What is System State Backup?**
A. Backup of critical Windows system files.

**Q. Can DPM backup VMware?**
A. Yes.

**Q. Can DPM restore VMM servers?**
A. Yes.

