# Frequently Asked Viva Questions

**Q. What is virtualization?**
A. Running multiple virtual machines on one physical server.

**Q. What is Hyper-V?**
A. Microsoft's hypervisor for creating virtual machines.

**Q. What is a Hypervisor?**
A. Software that creates and manages virtual machines.

**Q. Difference between Physical Machine and Virtual Machine?**
A. A physical machine is hardware; a virtual machine is software-based.

**Q. What is cloud computing?**
A. Delivering computing resources over the internet.

**Q. Types of cloud?**
A. Public, Private, and Hybrid.

**Q. What is automation?**
A. Performing tasks automatically without manual intervention.

**Q. What is disaster recovery?**
A. Restoring systems after failures.

**Q. Why use Microsoft System Center?**
A. To manage, monitor, automate, and protect IT infrastructure.

